{"step_index":407,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:19:00Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated to highlight the primary objective: scheduling an in-person, on-campus sit-down during the educator's planning period and room number.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Planning Period Sit-Down Copywriting & AI Generation\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has tuned its copywriting engine and Gemini prompt around the **primary goal: scheduling a 10-minute on-campus sit-down during the teacher's planning period**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. On-Campus Sit-Down Framing ([`src/services/aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts))\n- **Effortless & Low-Friction:**\n  - Mentions being on campus visiting their school (e.g. `VOL`).\n  - Proposes a 10-minute sit-down in their classroom (e.g. `Room 204`) during their specific planning window (`3rd Period`) or preferred time slot (`1. Mon 1-2 PM`).\n  - Connects the sit-down directly to their report card hot-button (*FRS calculation, 5% bonus, DROP timeline, 403b review*).\n- **Example Generated Text:**\n  > *\"Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from VOL and will be visiting campus this week. Does Mon 1-2 PM still work for a quick 10-min sit-down in your room to review your 403(b) and 5% bonus options?\"*\n\n---\n\n## 2. Review & Editability:\n- Appears in the full-screen editable preview before sending.\n- 1-tap presets to focus on **Meeting Slot**, **5% Bonus & DROP**, or **Planning Period**.\n\n---\n\n## How to Test:\n1. Refresh `http://localhost:8081`.\n2. Launch the Power Dialer and tap **ValuTeachers SMS** to test the planning period sit-down copy generator!\n","Description":"Walkthrough highlighting planning period sit-down focus","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for sit-down copywriting","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with sit-down copy"}}]}
