{"step_index":409,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:19:04Z","content":"The **copywriting engine** and **Gemini prompt** have been calibrated around that objective: **scheduling a quick, convenient on-campus sit-down during their planning period or in their classroom**.\n\n---\n\n### How the Persuasive Sit-Down Messaging Operates:\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              SIT-DOWN FOCUSED PERSUASIVE SMS DRAFT (PREVIEW)                     │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                                  │\n│  [CONTEXT SYNTHESIZED BY GEMINI]:                                                │\n│  • Teacher: Joseph Adona • VOL (Volusia County) • Room 204 • 3rd Period Planning │\n│  • Checked Report Card Inquiries: 403(b) review, Guaranteed 5% Bonus             │\n│  • Requested Availability on Card: 1. Mon 1-2 PM (during planning)               │\n│                                                                                  │\n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │ DRAFTED SIT-DOWN TEXT:                                                     │  │\n│  │                                                                            │  │\n│  │ \"Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card    │  │\n│  │  from VOL and will be visiting campus this week. Does Mon 1-2 PM still     │  │\n│  │  work for a quick 10-min sit-down in your room to review your 403(b) and   │  │\n│  │  5% bonus options?\"                                                        │  │\n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                                                                                  │\n│   [ 🎯 Meeting Slot ]     [ 💰 5% Bonus & DROP ]     [ 🏫 Planning Period ]      │\n│                                                                                  │\n│   [ CANCEL ]                                     [ OPEN IN SMS APP ]             │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Strategy Points Implemented in the Engine:\n\n1. **Effortless On-Campus Framing:**\n   - Mentions being on campus visiting their school (e.g. `VOL`), making the sit-down feel low-friction, natural, and non-intrusive.\n2. **Classroom & Planning Period Anchoring:**\n   - Automatically targets their specific planning window (`3rd Period`) or classroom (`Room 204`) from the report card data.\n3. **Specific Retirement Hot-Button Linkage:**\n   - Ties the sit-down directly to what they requested (e.g., *calculating their exact DROP numbers*, *reviewing 403(b) options*, or *explaining the 5% bonus*).\n4. **100% Editable & Previewed:**\n   - Every single generated text loads into the full-screen editor so you can review, tweak, or add personal notes before clicking **\"Open in SMS App\"** to send.\n\n---\n\n### How to Test:\nRefresh `http://localhost:8081` (or run `npx expo start --web`), tap **Launch Power Dialer**, and click **ValuTeachers SMS** to test the new sit-down focused copywriting engine!"}
