{"step_index":411,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:21:14Z","thinking":"**Refining Communication Length**\n\nI've taken the feedback into account and am now working to address the meeting time constraint. The tone and format of the previous message were well-received, so I'm focusing on condensing the message length while retaining its effectiveness. I'm currently working on adjusting the content length in `src/services/aiSmsService.ts` to accommodate the 45-minute meetings.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update sit-down duration to full planning period in AiSmsService","EndLine":115,"Instruction":"Update prompt instructions and fallback template to refer to full planning period sit-downs","ReplacementContent":"PRIMARY OBJECTIVE:\nSchedule an in-person sit-down with the teacher during their full planning period (or classroom/room number as indicated on their report card) to review their FRS state pension calculation, 403(b) options, DROP timeline, and the 5% bonus. Note that these sit-down consultations are comprehensive and take place during their planning session.\n\nContext for Educator:\n- Educator Name: ${lead.name}\n- School / District: ${lead.school || 'Florida School District'}\n- Planning Period / Room: ${lead.planning_period || 'N/A'}${lead.room_number ? `, Room ${lead.room_number}` : ''}\n- Years in FRS: ${lead.years_in_frs || 'N/A'} years\n- FRS Knowledge Level: \"${lead.frs_knowledge || 'Moderate'}\"\n- Specific Needs / Inquiries Checked on Report Card: ${interests}\n- Educator's Written Question: \"${lead.custom_questions || 'None'}\"\n- Requested Sit-Down / Meeting Availability: ${preferredTimes}\n- Current Call Outcome: ${currentDisposition || 'Follow-up'}\n- Previous Contact History & Notes:\n${historySummary || 'First outreach attempt.'}\n- ValuTeachers Representative Name: ${agentName}\n\nStrategy & Tone Guidelines:\n1. Focus on scheduling the SIT-DOWN: Frame the message around locking in a sit-down during their planning period (${lead.planning_period || 'planning period'}) or preferred slot (${preferredTimes}).\n2. Mention being on campus / visiting ${lead.school || 'the school'} so the sit-down feels effortless, convenient, and focused on their classroom.\n3. Subtly persuasive & consultative: Avoid aggressive sales language. Speak as a trusted educational retirement advisor who received their handwritten request.\n4. Seamlessly incorporate their specific interest (e.g. 5% bonus on contributions, DROP calculation, or 403b clarity).\n5. Length: Keep between 180 and 240 characters for immediate readability on mobile screens.\n6. Frictionless Call-to-Action: Ask a simple confirmation question (e.g. \"I'll be at ${lead.school || 'the school'} this week—does ${preferredTimes} still work for a sit-down during your planning period in your room to review your options, or is another day better?\").\n7. Output ONLY the raw SMS text without quotes or preamble.\n`;\n\n      const endpoint = `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent?key=${key}`;\n\n      const response = await fetch(endpoint, {\n        method: 'POST',\n        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n        body: JSON.stringify({\n          contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }],\n          generationConfig: {\n            temperature: 0.3,\n            maxOutputTokens: 180,\n          },\n        }),\n      });\n\n      if (!response.ok) {\n        throw new Error(`Gemini API returned status ${response.status}`);\n      }\n\n      const data = await response.json();\n      const text = data?.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text?.trim();\n      if (text) {\n        return text.replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, '');\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('AI SMS generation failed, falling back to local copy:', e);\n    }\n\n    return this.getFallbackSMS(lead);\n  }\n\n  private static getFallbackSMS(lead: Lead): string {\n    const firstName = lead.name ? lead.name.split(' ')[0] : 'there';\n    const school = lead.school || 'your school';\n    const planning = lead.planning_period || 'your planning period';\n    const room = lead.room_number ? ` in Room ${lead.room_number}` : '';\n    const primaryTime =\n      lead.meeting_preferences && lead.meeting_preferences.length > 0\n        ? lead.meeting_preferences[0].replace(/^[0-9]\\.\\s*/, '')\n        : `during ${planning}`;\n\n    if (lead.years_in_frs && parseInt(lead.years_in_frs, 10) >= 15) {\n      return `Hi ${firstName}, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${school} regarding your ${lead.years_in_frs} yrs of service and DROP options. I'll be on campus this week—does ${primaryTime} work for a sit-down during ${planning}${room}?`;\n    }\n\n    return `Hi ${firstName}, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${school} regarding your retirement & 403(b) review. I'll be visiting campus this week—does ${primaryTime} work for a sit-down during your planning period${room}?`;\n  }","StartLine":40,"TargetContent":"PRIMARY OBJECTIVE:\nSchedule a brief, convenient in-person sit-down with the teacher (at their school during their planning period or in their classroom/room number as indicated on their report card) to review their FRS state pension calculation, 403(b) options, DROP timeline, and the 5% bonus.\n\nContext for Educator:\n- Educator Name: ${lead.name}\n- School / District: ${lead.school || 'Florida School District'}\n- Planning Period / Room: ${lead.planning_period || 'N/A'}${lead.room_number ? `, Room ${lead.room_number}` : ''}\n- Years in FRS: ${lead.years_in_frs || 'N/A'} years\n- FRS Knowledge Level: \"${lead.frs_knowledge || 'Moderate'}\"\n- Specific Needs / Inquiries Checked on Report Card: ${interests}\n- Educator's Written Question: \"${lead.custom_questions || 'None'}\"\n- Requested Sit-Down / Meeting Availability: ${preferredTimes}\n- Current Call Outcome: ${currentDisposition || 'Follow-up'}\n- Previous Contact History & Notes:\n${historySummary || 'First outreach attempt.'}\n- ValuTeachers Representative Name: ${agentName}\n\nStrategy & Tone Guidelines:\n1. Focus on scheduling the SIT-DOWN: Frame the message around locking in a quick 10-15 minute sit-down during their planning period (${lead.planning_period || 'planning period'}) or preferred slot (${preferredTimes}).\n2. Mention being on campus / visiting ${lead.school || 'the school'} to make the sit-down feel effortless, low-friction, and convenient.\n3. Subtly persuasive & consultative: Avoid aggressive sales language. Speak as a trusted educational retirement advisor who received their handwritten request.\n4. Seamlessly incorporate their specific interest (e.g. 5% bonus on contributions, DROP calculation, or 403b clarity).\n5. Length: Keep between 180 and 240 characters for immediate readability on mobile screens.\n6. Frictionless Call-to-Action: Ask a simple confirmation question (e.g. \"I'll be at ${lead.school || 'the school'} this week—would ${preferredTimes} work for a quick sit-down in your room, or is tomorrow better?\").\n7. Output ONLY the raw SMS text without quotes or preamble.\n`;\n\n      const endpoint = `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent?key=${key}`;\n\n      const response = await fetch(endpoint, {\n        method: 'POST',\n        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n        body: JSON.stringify({\n          contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }],\n          generationConfig: {\n            temperature: 0.3,\n            maxOutputTokens: 180,\n          },\n        }),\n      });\n\n      if (!response.ok) {\n        throw new Error(`Gemini API returned status ${response.status}`);\n      }\n\n      const data = await response.json();\n      const text = data?.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text?.trim();\n      if (text) {\n        return text.replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, '');\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('AI SMS generation failed, falling back to local copy:', e);\n    }\n\n    return this.getFallbackSMS(lead);\n  }\n\n  private static getFallbackSMS(lead: Lead): string {\n    const firstName = lead.name ? lead.name.split(' ')[0] : 'there';\n    const school = lead.school || 'your school';\n    const planning = lead.planning_period || 'your planning period';\n    const room = lead.room_number ? ` in Room ${lead.room_number}` : '';\n    const primaryTime =\n      lead.meeting_preferences && lead.meeting_preferences.length > 0\n        ? lead.meeting_preferences[0].replace(/^[0-9]\\.\\s*/, '')\n        : `during ${planning}`;\n\n    if (lead.years_in_frs && parseInt(lead.years_in_frs, 10) >= 15) {\n      return `Hi ${firstName}, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${school} regarding your ${lead.years_in_frs} yrs of service and DROP options. I'll be at the school this week—does ${primaryTime} work for a quick 10-min sit-down${room}?`;\n    }\n\n    return `Hi ${firstName}, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I received your FRS Report Card from ${school} regarding your retirement & 403(b) review. I'll be visiting campus this week—does ${primaryTime} work for a quick 10-min sit-down during ${planning}?`;\n  }","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\services\\aiSmsService.ts","toolAction":"Updating AiSmsService for planning period sit-down","toolSummary":"Update AiSmsService.ts planning duration"}}]}
