{"step_index":419,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:21:30Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated to calibrate the copy for full planning period sit-down consultations.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Planning Period Sit-Down Copywriting & AI Generation\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has calibrated its AI copywriting engine around **scheduling an in-person sit-down during the teacher's full planning period**:\n\n---\n\n## 1. Planning Period Sit-Down Framing ([`src/services/aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts))\n- **Effortless, Professional & Room-Specific:**\n  - Mentions being on campus visiting their school (e.g. `VOL`).\n  - Proposes a sit-down in their classroom (e.g. `Room 204`) during their planning period or preferred slot (`1. Mon 1-2 PM`).\n  - Connects the sit-down directly to their report card inquiries (*FRS state pension calculation, 5% bonus, DROP timeline, 403b review*).\n- **Refined Example Generated Text:**\n  > *\"Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from VOL and will be visiting campus this week. Does Mon 1-2 PM still work for a sit-down during your planning period in your room to review your 403(b) and 5% bonus options?\"*\n\n---\n\n## 2. Review & Editability:\n- Appears in the full-screen editable preview before sending.\n- 1-tap presets to focus on **Meeting Slot**, **5% Bonus & DROP**, or **Planning Period**.\n\n---\n\n## How to Test:\n1. Refresh `http://localhost:8081`.\n2. Launch the Power Dialer and tap **ValuTeachers SMS** to test the planning period sit-down copy generator!\n","Description":"Walkthrough updated for full planning period sit-down consultations","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for full planning period sit-down","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with planning sit-down copy"}}]}
