{"step_index":421,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:21:33Z","content":"This calibration is now complete across the entire AI copywriting engine, prompt instructions, and fallback SMS templates.\n\n---\n\n### Refined Planning Period Sit-Down Example:\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              SIT-DOWN FOCUSED PERSUASIVE SMS DRAFT (PREVIEW)                     │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                                  │\n│  [CONTEXT SYNTHESIZED BY GEMINI]:                                                │\n│  • Teacher: Joseph Adona • VOL (Volusia County) • Room 204 • 3rd Period Planning │\n│  • Checked Report Card Inquiries: 403(b) review, Guaranteed 5% Bonus             │\n│  • Requested Availability on Card: 1. Mon 1-2 PM (during planning)               │\n│                                                                                  │\n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │ DRAFTED SIT-DOWN TEXT:                                                     │  │\n│  │                                                                            │  │\n│  │ \"Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card    │  │\n│  │  from VOL and will be visiting campus this week. Does Mon 1-2 PM still     │  │\n│  │  work for a sit-down during your planning period in your room to review    │  │\n│  │  your 403(b) and 5% bonus options?\"                                        │  │\n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                                                                                  │\n│   [ 🎯 Meeting Slot ]     [ 💰 5% Bonus & DROP ]     [ 🏫 Planning Period ]      │\n│                                                                                  │\n│   [ CANCEL ]                                     [ OPEN IN SMS APP ]             │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### What Was Updated:\n\n1. **Duration Framing:**\n   - Removed any *\"quick 10-minute\"* wording.\n   - Anchored directly to **\"a sit-down during your planning period\"** (or during their requested time slot).\n2. **On-Campus Room Specifics:**\n   - Naturally mentions visiting the school campus and sitting down in their classroom/room number.\n3. **Report Card Need Alignment:**\n   - Seamlessly ties the sit-down consultation to their specific inquiries (*FRS calculation*, *5% bonus*, *DROP options*, *403(b) review*).\n\n---\n\n### How to Test:\nRefresh your browser tab at `http://localhost:8081` (or run `npx expo start --web`), tap **Launch Power Dialer**, and tap **ValuTeachers SMS** to test the updated planning period sit-down copy generator!"}
