{"step_index":441,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:52:25Z","content":"Your standalone production app bundle in **`dist`** is compiled and ready. I also just injected the iOS standalone tags so when you add it to your home screen, it launches like a native app (without Safari toolbars or address bars).\n\nHere is how to deploy it in **30 seconds for \\$0**:\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Deploy to Free Cloud Hosting\n\nChoose either **Option A (Surge - 1 Command)** or **Option B (Netlify Drag & Drop)**:\n\n#### Option A: 1 Command via Surge (Fastest)\nIn your terminal, run:\n```cmd\nnpx surge dist\n```\n1. It will ask for an **email** and a **password** (creates your free instant account).\n2. It will show: `project: dist` $\\rightarrow$ press **Enter**.\n3. It will show a domain (or type your own, e.g. `valuteachers-snapdialer.surge.sh`) $\\rightarrow$ press **Enter**.\n4. Surge uploads and gives you the live HTTPS link in 5 seconds!\n\n---\n\n#### Option B: Netlify Drag-and-Drop (No CLI needed)\n1. Open [app.netlify.com/drop](https://app.netlify.com/drop) in your PC browser.\n2. Drag and drop the folder:\n   `C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\dist`\n   directly onto that webpage.\n3. Netlify immediately generates a live public URL for you.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Install onto Your iPhone Home Screen\n1. Open that live URL in **Safari** on your iPhone.\n2. Tap the **Share** button (the square with an arrow pointing up at the bottom of Safari).\n3. Scroll down and tap **\"Add to Home Screen\"**.\n4. Tap **Add** (top right).\n\n---\n\n### You Are Now Done & Independent:\n- **You can shut down your PC entirely.**\n- Tap the **SnapDialer** app icon on your iPhone home screen. It will open full-screen like any standard app, persist your data locally, use your camera for document scanning, and trigger your phone calls and texts natively through your SIM card!"}
