{"step_index":443,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:55:25Z","content":"To complete the publish in one quick command, specify your domain name at the end:\n\n```cmd\nnpx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh\n```\n\n*(If prompted for an email and password, enter any email and password to create your free Surge token, then press Enter).*\n\n---\n\n### Alternative:\nYou can also step directly into the `dist` directory and run surge interactively:\n```cmd\ncd dist\nnpx surge\n```\n*(Press Enter when prompted for the project path and domain).*\n\n---\n\nOnce it prints **`Success! Project is published to ...`**, simply open that URL in **Safari on your iPhone**, tap **Share $\\rightarrow$ Add to Home Screen**, and you'll have the full standalone app running independently on your phone!"}
