{"step_index":450,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T17:00:57Z","content":"They do not publish automatically the moment code is edited locally, but we have made updating your live app a **1-command, 10-second process**.\n\n---\n\n### How to Publish Updates Going Forward:\n\nWhenever we add new features, tweak prompts, or fix bugs, you (or I) simply run:\n\n```cmd\nnpm run deploy\n```\n\nThis single command automatically:\n1. Recompiles your latest changes into the production bundle.\n2. Pushes the update to your live Surge domain.\n\n---\n\n### How the Update Appears on Your iPhone:\n- **No need to re-install or re-add the app to your home screen.**\n- Simply open the app (or close and re-open it), and the new version loads immediately on your phone!\n\n---\n\nFeel free to run through your tests on the phone (scanning report cards, testing the HUD, checking the proof viewer, dialing, and AI SMS drafting) and let me know what tweaks, styling improvements, or adjustments you'd like made!"}
